            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ahakuba omugabe akaba aine eigana ry'emeeri aha nyanja ya Tarushiishi hamwe n'erya Hiraamu. Omurundi gumwe omu myaka eshatu, ago magana g'emeeri gakaba gaija gareetsire ezaabu, efeeza, emiino y'enjojo, enkobe na zaanyamunyonyi.",
          "type": "text",
